WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,360 --> 00:00:07,360
Visibility is less than 100 meters

2
00:00:07,360 --> 00:00:09,360
You haven't stabilized your driving skills yet

3
00:00:09,360 --> 00:00:12,420
I'm usually either at home or in the kitchen

4
00:00:12,420 --> 00:00:15,420
I only go back to my hometown twice a year and take the expressway.

5
00:00:15,420 --> 00:00:28,590
What a big ice cube

6
00:00:28,590 --> 00:00:33,790
Don't let your sister be distracted

7
00:00:33,790 --> 00:00:34,790
Don't follow too close

8
00:00:34,790 --> 00:00:35,790
Keep gear

9
00:00:35,790 --> 00:00:39,180
Go to the next service area and hide.

10
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:42,900
Scared to death

11
00:00:42,900 --> 00:00:44,900
Why does this ice pack look like a washbasin?

12
00:00:44,900 --> 00:00:58,610
This time it's all down to luck

13
00:00:58,610 --> 00:01:00,610
But I've always been very lucky
